==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1~4 seconds<sup>30f~120f</sup>.
*10 [[Celeboodle]]s (600%) spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Celeboodle]]s (700%) spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Celeboodle]]s (800%) spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Celeboodle]]s (900%) spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s (100%) spawn after 266.67 seconds<sup>8,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.33~2 seconds<sup>10f~60f</sup>.
**15 [[Celeboodle]]s (600%) spawn, delay 3~8 seconds<sup>90f~240f</sup>.
**15 [[Celeboodle]]s (600%) spawn, delay 0.2~0.4 seconds<sup>6f~12f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.
**30 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.2 seconds<sup>2f~6f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While the stage can be difficult, the best way to beat this stage in all stars is by stalling with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|double]] [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Macho]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|double]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Wall]]. Use [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|C. Sexy Legs]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|double]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dragons]] to deal with the Trolly Bloggers and Celeboodles, while using Ururun and Bahamut to kill off Teacher Bear. To activate this, stall the enemies until you have max cash. Spawn main attackers, keep spawning Dragons and Legs, ''but'' only spawn Walls until you reach the enemy base. Otherwise you could reach the cat limit very quickly, causing you to lose extraordinarily fast. The Sloth will be killed with heavy stalling after the Celeboodles are killed.

